      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. can you give me a more concrete example of how that actually looks in a news report? like, if a group of mostly white suburbanites is blocking a highway to protest a new law, vs if a group of predominantly Black youths is doing something similar in a city center... how would the actual vocabulary and the \"vibe\" of the reporting differ in those two cases?",
